# tally 2.1.8 item 77 (#201), E §4.1 step 2 and L §4.4: a test of a window-dated movement that comes out one way on
# some of its days and another on the rest is the window's hole, as far as the refusal or the other class would reach.
# The first property: a test every candidate fails stays the refusal. put moves into late, alive from 03-20, on a
# day of window(03-05, 03-10), outside its lifespan on every day: refused, as before. take empties pot (min 0) on
# 04-06 while give's 20.00 PLN may or may not have come (window(04-05, 04-10)): -50.00 or -30.00 PLN, refused either
# way, on 04-06, with the balance the pending leg leaves out. 2.1.7's refcore didn't test pot while give was pending
# and refused it on 04-10 (-30.00 PLN).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind accts: place PLN signed
kind pots: place PLN min 0
place jar: accts lives 2025-01-01..
place late: accts lives 2026-03-20..
place pot: pots lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input small: money PLN
input wd: date
input wi: date
input wt: date

move put: transfers
  on wd
  leg cash from jar to late amount amt

move take: transfers
  on wt
  leg cash from pot to world amount amt

move give: transfers
  on wi
  leg cash from world to pot amount small

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  small = 20.00 PLN "s"
  wd = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) "s"
  wi = window(2026-04-05, 2026-04-10) "s"
  wt = 2026-04-06 "s"
  opening[jar] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[late] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-03-20 start "s"
  opening[pot] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask l1: bal(jar, 2026-03-31)
ask l2: bal(jar, 2026-03-31) windows each
ask s1: bal(pot, 2026-04-30)
ask s2: bal(pot, 2026-04-30) windows each
=== expect
l1: refused: RUN-LIFESPAN put.cash moves into or out of late outside its lifespan
  cut 2026-01-01
l2: refused: RUN-LIFESPAN put.cash moves into or out of late outside its lifespan
  cut 2026-01-01
s1: refused: RUN-PLACE pot is -50.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-04-06
  cut 2026-01-01
s2: refused: RUN-PLACE pot is -50.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-04-06
  cut 2026-01-01
